Growing Kingdom Privacy Policy

Effective Date: September 30, 2026
Last Updated: September 30, 2026

Growing Kingdom is a game developed and published by Shekinah Weleful Designs.

This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use Growing Kingdom.

Application: Growing Kingdom
Android Package: com.shekinahwelefuldesigns.growingkingdom

Information Collection

Growing Kingdom does not collect, transmit, sell, rent, or share personal information with the developer or third parties.

The game does not require you to create an account, sign in, or provide personal information.

Growing Kingdom does not use:

Advertising services or advertising SDKs
Analytics or tracking services
Crash-reporting services that transmit information to the developer
Firebase services
Cloud save services
In-app purchase or billing services
Push notifications or remote messaging services
Location services
Contacts
Camera access
Microphone access
Photos, videos, or other personal media
Device advertising identifiers for tracking
Local Game Data

Growing Kingdom stores game information locally on your device so that your progress can be restored between play sessions.

This local information may include:

Kingdom progress
Current and previous run progress
Resources
Buildings and upgrades
Villagers and their assigned priorities
Units and army configurations
Missions and unlocks
Prestige and Ascension progress
Gameplay statistics
Game settings and preferences
Information required to calculate offline progress and rewards, such as the time the game was last played

This information remains on your device and is not transmitted to Shekinah Weleful Designs.

Growing Kingdom does not operate a server or cloud database containing your game progress.

Internet and Network Access

The current version of Growing Kingdom does not require internet access for its gameplay systems and does not transmit gameplay information to the developer.

The game may provide optional links to external services, such as community, support, privacy, or store pages. If you choose to open an external link, you leave Growing Kingdom and interact directly with that third-party service.

Any information processed by an external service is governed by that service's own privacy policy and terms.

Notifications

Growing Kingdom does not use push notifications, remote messaging services, or gameplay notifications delivered while the application is closed.

Google Play and Platform Services

If you download Growing Kingdom through Google Play or another application marketplace, the marketplace and your device operating system may process information independently of Growing Kingdom.

Shekinah Weleful Designs does not control information collected directly by Google Play, Android, or other distribution platforms. Their own privacy policies apply to their processing of that information.

Data Sharing

Growing Kingdom does not share personal information or gameplay data with third parties because the game does not collect or transmit such information.

Data Retention and Deletion

Game progress and settings are stored locally on your device.

Because Shekinah Weleful Designs does not receive or maintain a server-side copy of this data, the developer has no remote copy to retain or delete.

You can remove Growing Kingdom's locally stored information by clearing the application's data through your device settings or by uninstalling the application.

Once local game data is removed, Shekinah Weleful Designs cannot restore it because no cloud copy is maintained by the developer.

Children's Privacy

Growing Kingdom does not knowingly collect personal information from children.

Because Growing Kingdom does not collect personal information from its users, the developer does not maintain personal information belonging to children or adults through the game.

External platforms or services accessed separately from Growing Kingdom are governed by their own privacy policies and age requirements.

Security

Growing Kingdom is designed so that game progress and settings remain locally on the player's device rather than being transmitted to servers operated by Shekinah Weleful Designs.

The security of locally stored information also depends on the security of your device and operating system.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated if Growing Kingdom's features or data practices change.

For example, if a future version introduces advertising, analytics, online services, cloud saves, accounts, purchases, notifications, or other services that process user information, this Privacy Policy will be updated to describe those practices.

Any changes will be reflected by updating the Last Updated date at the beginning of this policy.

